---
/** 文章内的套餐对照表，读取 plans.ts 统一数据 */
import { PLANS } from '../data/plans';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---
<figure class="plan-table">
  <div class="scroll" role="region" aria-label="灵动云套餐对照表" tabindex="0">
    <table>
      <caption>灵动云 {PLANS.length} 档套餐对照（资料整理于 {SITE.dataUpdated}）</caption>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">套餐</th>
          <th scope="col">价格</th>
          <th scope="col">付款方式</th>
          <th scope="col">流量</th>
          <th scope="col">流量周期</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {PLANS.map((p) => (
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">{p.name}</th>
            <td class="num">{p.displayPrice}<small>{p.displayPriceSuffix}</small></td>
            <td>{p.paymentLabel}</td>
            <td class="num traffic">{p.displayTraffic}</td>
            <td>{p.trafficLabel}</td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <figcaption>月付价格标注“起”，最终以结算页为准；重置日、设备数等规则以用户中心为准。<a href="/#plans">在首页查看套餐卡片</a></figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .plan-table {
    margin: 32px 0;
  }
  .scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 15px;
    min-width: 560px;
  }
  caption {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  th,
  td {
    padding: 10px 14px;
    text-align: left;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  thead th {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  tbody th {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .num {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .num small {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-left: 3px;
  }
  .traffic {
    color: var(--traffic);
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
